    "summary": "Flask; lost-wax cast in brass. Narrow cylinder in form with rounded base and narrow neck. Four loops for suspension at sides. Four raised bands create three separate registers. Angled interlace pattern with stippling below neck. Top register has images of four male figures with background stippling. Second register decorated with angled interlace pattern and stippling. Bottom register has Portuguese heads, floral and plant motifs with stippling.",
